# Line endings
#
# The repo previously stored a mix: 21 files as CRLF in the index, but
# account.html and track-order.html as LF. That produced phantom "every line
# changed" diffs whenever the project moved between machines or was zipped.
#
# `text=auto eol=crlf` normalises everything to LF inside the repository while
# checking out CRLF in the working tree, which is what the Windows toolchain
# here already expects. Change `eol=crlf` to `eol=lf` if the project ever moves
# to a Unix-only workflow.

*                text=auto eol=crlf

# Binary — never touch these
*.woff2          binary
*.webp           binary
*.png            binary
*.jpg            binary
*.jpeg           binary
*.ico            binary
*.zip            binary

# SVG is text, but keep it LF so favicon/icon diffs stay readable
*.svg            text eol=lf

# Treat these as text with sensible diffs
*.html           text eol=crlf diff=html
*.css            text eol=crlf diff=css
*.js             text eol=crlf
*.md             text eol=crlf
*.json           text eol=crlf
*.py             text eol=lf
